{"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6Events11EventRecordV2id20FoundationEssentials4UUIDVvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV","text":"UUID"}],"title":"id","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"EventRecord.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/EventRecord.swift#L23"}},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/id"},"abstract":[{"text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it had when first delivered.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It identifies the record, not a person: it is drawn for this record alone, never derived"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the device, the user, the session or another record, and two records never share one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collector that receives a record twice, as a redelivered record can be, keeps one copy by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/id":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/id","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it had when first delivered."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"id","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Events","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","url":"\/documentation\/events","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A tracked event: the event itself, when it was tracked, where, and the context it was tracked in.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"identifier"}],